<title>USA: Toyota December U.S. car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Toyota December U.S. car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Dec 1-31, 1996     Dec 1-31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    36,956	    46,117	    -19.9</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   9,661	    12,623	    -23.5</p>
<p> Import Car		16,700	    27,146	    -38.5</p>
<p> Import Truck	    18,730	    13,489	    +38.9</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Dec 31, 1996 Jan 1-Dec 31, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   555,746	   498,635	    +10.7</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	 142,281	   112,602	    +25.5</p>
<p> Import Car	     237,846	   295,339	    -20.0</p>
<p> Import Truck	   223,845	   176,775	    +25.8</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 308 for year to date vs 306 in year ago.</p>
</text>
